{
  "dom_id": "step-193673",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Solving When the Right-Hand Side Is Zero",
  "problem": "Solve for $n$ where $n^2 +12n = 0.$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we factor the left-hand side.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{n}^{2}+12n & =0 \\\\ n(n+12) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we apply the zero product rule to get \n\n$$\nn=0 \\qquad\\text{or}\\qquad n+12=0,\n$$\n\nwhich in turn gives \n\n$$\nn=0 \\qquad\\text{or}\\qquad n=-12.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $n=-12,0.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-193673\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"193673\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"14827\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-193673\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">Solving When the Right-Hand Side Is Zero</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"193673\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                      